The example pechas in this folder were made by the pecha skill from pages of
Lotsawa House (https://www.lotsawahouse.org). They carry the Tibetan text,
transliteration and translation of those pages, unaltered.

They are not covered by the MIT licence of the code in this repository.

All texts on Lotsawa House are licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Translated materials are the property of Lotsawa House and/or its
contributing authors. You may copy and redistribute these pechas for
non-commercial purposes only, with attribution to the source, the translator
and the licence. The title, translator, version and source address of each
pecha are listed in README.md in this folder, and on the last page of each PDF.

Terms of Lotsawa House: https://www.lotsawahouse.org/about/terms
